.SH DESCRIPTION
Edit a title of an issue


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-t\fP, \fB--title\fP=""
	Provide a title to describe the issue

.PP
\fB--non-interactive\fP[=false]
	Do not ask for user input

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for edit


